feov-record: lens: record: verify requires --trust high|medium|low (got "banana") — the grade is the whole content of a verification's claim about its source; an unreadable one makes it incomparable with every other row in the ledger it lands in. Named `trust` because blue's `confidence` grades a CLAIM and this grades a SOURCE — one word for two questions is how the two acts came to share an event type (#341)

